#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KComboBox, location)
#: config/publicTransportStopConfig.ui:34
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>The country the stop/station/airport is in. <note>Only matching "
"service providers will be shown.</note></para>\n"
"<para>You can also <emphasis strong='1'>show all available service "
"providers</emphasis> or only <emphasis strong='1'>international</emphasis> "
"ones.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Zemlja u kojoj se stajalište/stanica/aerodrom nalazi. <note>Samo "
"podudarajući pružatelji usluge će biti prikazani.</note></para>\n"
"<para>Možete također prikazati <emphasis strong='1'>sve dostupne pružatelje "
"usluga</emphasis> ili samo <emphasis strong='1'>internacionalne</emphasis> ."
"</para>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, lblServiceProvider)
